From dd4166411566b6d3fdff73afb4af2e6642eb9322 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 06:54:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] fix(kanban): select reviewers independently of
 author pins

Resolve review handoff overrides before generic implementation pins; otherwise choose a distinct strong/deep reviewer with worker eligibility. Persist implementer_model and fail closed before spawn on missing reviewer receipts. Preserve ready/retry pins and retry budget on admission failure.

Proof: initial regression RED (5 failed, 2 controls passed); focused baseline 42 passed, 15/15 routing and safety mutants killed; integration selection 158 passed; scripts/check 16 checks OK. Read-only replay: 37 board/shadow paths, 13899 rows, 679 review candidates, 214 changed copies / 148 unique cards; all changed inputs inspected. Live deployment proof pending.
